      "raw_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/raw/85b76609a6946c5d14b18076bddfec9ebddabcfe/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2026-02-13-12-00-00.gh-issue-144759.d3qYpe.rst",
